= Domain Name System — Technical =

DNS resolution traverses or queries a distributed hierarchy of authoritative and recursive components. Records are cached under time-to-live rules, so observed answers depend on delegation, caching state, resolver behavior, and record type.

== Modeling / implementation cautions ==
* DNS ≠ World Wide Web
* domain name ≠ URI
* DNS record ≠ guaranteed truth about a service

